{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/40130-purified-and-the-god-machine-spirit-rules","id":40130,"title":"Purified and the God-Machine Spirit Rules","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2013-12-31T13:25:22-08:00","id":40130,"title":"Purified and the God-Machine Spirit Rules","content":"I recently picked up WoD: Immortals, and I have been working on converting the system to work with the new GMC rules update. The Experience system is pretty easy to convert over (2 experiences for Numina and 1 experience per dot of Siddhi), but I'm having trouble figuring out a couple of things.<br /> <br /> 1. How does one represent player Purified characters who are spirit projecting into the Shadow? Do you average their traits to get power/finesse/resistance? Should they subject to the (complicated) new Spirit rules?<br /> 2. Should they be able to buy any of the numina available to spirits in the God-Machine Chronicle? So far, I'm saying yes.<br /> 3. Is any reason Purified shouldn't be able to buy Forsaken gifts at the same cost as Siddhi? (Maximum dot value capped by effective spirit rank.)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Mage: the Ascension - <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1191028-redesigned-prime-sphere\" target=\"_blank\">Redesigned Prime Sphere</a>; <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1188769-simpler-wonder-creation\" target=\"_blank\">Streamlined Wonder Creation</a><br /> Mummy: the Curse - <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mummy-the-curse/474927-mummy-the-curse-2e-conversion\" target=\"_blank\">Lightweight 2E Conversion</a>; <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mummy-the-curse/22378-second-sight-tradition-disciples-of-duat\" target=\"_blank\">Disciples of Duat</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/61-octavo","name":"Octavo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar61_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1171"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-31T14:24:00-08:00","id":40151,"title":"","content":"I wouldn't let them get Gifts because they're not Uratha.<br /> <br /> I've been pondering the rules and I think averaging might work, though adding them together and dividing them by two might produce significantly stronger Purified.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I am no longer participating in the community. Please do not contact me about my previous work.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/159-leetsepeak","name":"Leetsepeak","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-31T14:32:40-08:00","id":40156,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Leetsepeak</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/40130-purified-and-the-god-machine-spirit-rules?p=40151#post40151\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I wouldn't let them get Gifts because they're not Uratha.</div> </div> </div> </div>Claimed have access to Gifts as Aspects and several Gifts have been explicitly viable as Numina since Werewolf Core.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-31T14:38:40-08:00","id":40161,"title":"","content":"Having not read Werewolf, that's entirely my fault and makes sense then. Mea culpa!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I am no longer participating in the community. Please do not contact me about my previous work.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/159-leetsepeak","name":"Leetsepeak","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-31T14:54:47-08:00","id":40168,"title":"","content":"Bearing in mind that they're not Uratha, I've added some restrictions on the Gifts they can purchase. Here's my Purified: GMC Expansion.<br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Trebuchet MS\"><span style=\"font-size:28px\">Immortals: the Purified</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#666666\"><span style=\"font-family:Trebuchet MS\"><i><span style=\"font-size:17px\">Setting expansion and GMC rules update</span></i></span></span><br /> <br /> <b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Trebuchet MS\"><span style=\"font-size:21px\">Character Creation</span></span></span></b><br /> <br /> <b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Trebuchet MS\"><span style=\"font-size:17px\">Mortal to Purified</span></span></span></b><br /> <b><span style=\"color:#666666\"><span style=\"font-family:Trebuchet MS\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Ritual </span></span></span></b><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">Intelligence + Occult (cannot be unskilled). Anything short of success indicates character death. If successful, the character is sent into the Shadow and must return to their body, which must not be moved, examined, or autopsied. </span></span></span><br /> <b><span style=\"color:#666666\"><span style=\"font-family:Trebuchet MS\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Template</span></span></span></b><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">The new Purified gains 1 dot of Chi and the Spirit Projection power. (Optional) Give them three experiences that can only be spent on Numina, Siddhi, or Gifts. They must roleplay gaining these abilities from spirits. </span></span></span><br /> <br /> <b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Trebuchet MS\"><span style=\"font-size:17px\">Starting as base Purified</span></span></span></b><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">A starting Purified at around 100 (if active) to 200 (less active) years of age has the following template added to Step Five of the character creation rules in the </span></span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><b><span style=\"font-size:15px\">World of Darkness </span></b></span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">as modified by the </span></span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><b><span style=\"font-size:15px\">God-Machine Chronicle Update</span></b></span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">. The Purified template includes 1 dot of Chi, 3 extra merit dots, 6 extra skill dots, 4 dots of Siddhi, Numina (each costs 2 dots), or Gifts. By the end of character creation, 2 of the character\u2019s dots must be in Occult. Chi can be increased during character creation for the cost of 5 merit points per dot of Chi. </span></span></span><br /> <br /> <b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Trebuchet MS\"><span style=\"font-size:17px\">Starting as older Purified</span></span></span></b><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">As base purified with extra experiences at character creation. </span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">Average 200-year-old or less active 300-year-old purified: 10 Bonus Experiences</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">Average 300-year-old or less active 450-year-old purified: 15 Bonus Experiences</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">Average 400-year-old or less active 600-year-old purified: 25 Bonus Experiences</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Trebuchet MS\"><span style=\"font-size:21px\">Experience costs</span></span></span></b><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\"><b><span style=\"font-size:15px\">Merit</span></b></span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">: 1 Experience per dot</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\"><b><span style=\"font-size:15px\">Skill Specialty</span></b></span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">: 1 Experience</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\"><b><span style=\"font-size:15px\">Skill</span></b></span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">: 2 Experiences per dot</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\"><b><span style=\"font-size:15px\">Attribute</span></b></span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">: 4 Experiences per dot</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\"><b><span style=\"font-size:15px\">Integrity</span></b></span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">: 2 Experiences per dot</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\"><b><span style=\"font-size:15px\">Willpower</span></b></span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">: 1 Experience per dot</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\"><b><span style=\"font-size:15px\">Chi</span></b></span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">: 5 Experiences per dot</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\"><b><span style=\"font-size:15px\">Numina</span></b></span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">: 2 Experiences</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\"><b><span style=\"font-size:15px\">Siddhi</span></b></span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">: 1 Experience per dot</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Trebuchet MS\"><span style=\"font-size:21px\">Gifts from Werewolf: the Forsaken</span></span></span></b><br /> <b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Trebuchet MS\"><span style=\"font-size:17px\">Gift Mechanics</span></span></span></b><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">Spirits generally grant their gifts to the Uratha, but some spirits can be convinced to teach them to respected Purified who provide them something of value in return. Purified cannot teach these to anyone unless they are projected into the Shadow with the \u201cSpirit Projection\u201d Siddhi. There, they are nearly indistinguishable from spirits, and can similarly teach these abilities to the Uratha or other Purified, provided something is provided in return. Gifts cost the same amount as Siddhi, but they are capped by the Purified\u2019s effective spirit rank (</span></span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><b><span style=\"font-size:15px\">Immortals</span></b></span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\"> p 100). Use the activation dice pool listed in </span></span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><b><span style=\"font-size:15px\">Werewolf: the Forsaken</span></b></span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">, but substitute the Purified\u2019s Chi in the place of the listed Renown trait. Gifts must be purchased in the order listed in </span></span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><b><span style=\"font-size:15px\">Werewolf: the Forsaken</span></b></span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">, unless the player spends 1 extra experience. </span></span></span><br /> <br /> <b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Trebuchet MS\"><span style=\"font-size:17px\">Gift Lists</span></span></span></b><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">Death </span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">Elemental</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">Evasion</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">Insight</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">Inspiration</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">Knowledge</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">Nature</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">Sharing</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">Stealth</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">Strength</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">Technology</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">Warding</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">Weather<br /> <br /> <b>To Do:</b><br /> Figure out Spirit form rules/conditions.<br /> Add Bans and Banes to more fully reflect the spiritual nature.<br /> Update Integrity to match the new state. </span></span></span>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Mage: the Ascension - <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1191028-redesigned-prime-sphere\" target=\"_blank\">Redesigned Prime Sphere</a>; <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1188769-simpler-wonder-creation\" target=\"_blank\">Streamlined Wonder Creation</a><br /> Mummy: the Curse - <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mummy-the-curse/474927-mummy-the-curse-2e-conversion\" target=\"_blank\">Lightweight 2E Conversion</a>; <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mummy-the-curse/22378-second-sight-tradition-disciples-of-duat\" target=\"_blank\">Disciples of Duat</a>","edited":{"userid":61,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/61-octavo","user":"Octavo","date":". 12-31-2013, 05:58 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/61-octavo","name":"Octavo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar61_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1171"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-01T00:05:51-08:00","id":40389,"title":"","content":"<b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Trebuchet MS\"><span style=\